    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Children who never grow old.\x01""What a waste of forever.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Stop trembling, sprout. I have\x01""not raised my hand. Yet.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""This forest has a new shadow.\x01""You are standing in it.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Tell me what you know, little\x01""one, and keep your leaves.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Your woods smell of fear. I\x01""find it refreshing.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""A child of the forest. Tell me,\x01""do you burn like the rest of\x01""it?",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""I walk where I please, child.\x01""Today it pleases me to be here.",
};
