    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Tell the others their king is\x01""pleased. For now.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Ride well, steal well, and\x01""answer only to me.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""The wind that blows from the\x01""desert will not bring death to\x01""us again. I swear it.",
};
static const char* const sHylianGreet[] = {
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Hylian. You are looking at your\x01""next king. Speak.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Do not shrink away. I am a\x01""guest of your court, after all.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Soft hands, soft life. Hyrule\x01""has made you all soft.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""I knelt to your king this\x01""morning. It will not happen\x01""twice. Well?",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""You there. A lord of the desert\x01""has a question.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""How loud this market is. It\x01""will be quieter under me.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Yes, I am the Gerudo. Stare if\x01""you must. Then answer me.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Your castle has fine walls. I\x01""have been admiring them from\x01""the inside.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Speak up. Fear makes you people\x01""mumble.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""A kingdom of shopkeepers and\x01""gossips. No wonder it is ripe.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""I am in a generous mood. Do not\x01""waste it.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""You have heard of me. Good.\x01""That saves time.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Peace has made you careless. I\x01""find careless people useful.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Tell me the talk of the town.\x01""Leave out nothing about the\x01""princess.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Look at me. Remember this day\x01""when you are asked who warned\x01""you.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""The sun is kind here. In the\x01""desert it kills. I prefer\x01""honest suns.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Another loyal subject. Loyal to\x01""whom, I wonder, in a year.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""I did not come to this city to\x01""be ignored. Speak.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Your goddesses left their power\x01""lying about. I intend to\x01""collect it.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Well? I have a throne to take\x01""and you are delaying me.",
};
static const char* const sHylianReply[] = {
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Is that so. Go on.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Hm. And your king knows of\x01""this?",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""How very Hylian. Continue.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Speak faster. I have a kingdom\x01""to take.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Interesting. You people tell\x01""strangers everything.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Yes, yes. And the princess?",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""I see. That will be useful to\x01""me.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Charming. Truly. What else?",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""You say it so proudly. I will\x01""remember that.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Go on. I am in no hurry. Hyrule\x01""is not going anywhere.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""A small trouble for a small\x01""person. And then?",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""So that is what passes for news\x01""here.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Hm. Peace has made your worries\x01""very small.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Do continue. Your fear is quite\x01""eloquent.",
};
static const char* const sHylianBye[] = {
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Enjoy the peace. It has days\x01""left.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Go about your business. Soon it\x01""will be my business.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Bow when I leave. Practise. You\x01""will need it.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Tell your king his guest sends\x01""his thanks for the hospitality.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""When the sky over the castle\x01""turns dark, remember I was\x01""polite.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Spend your rupees quickly. They\x01""will bear my face soon.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""I have what I wanted. You may\x01""breathe again.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Lock your doors. Not that locks\x01""concern me.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""This city will make a fine\x01""ruin. Good day.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Give my regards to the\x01""princess, if you see her before\x01""I do.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Keep that fear. It will keep\x01""you alive under my rule.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Enough. The air here is too\x01""sweet for my liking.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Pray if it comforts you. The\x01""goddesses are not listening.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""One day you will say you spoke\x01""with the King of Evil. Few\x01""will.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Back to your stall. The world\x01""ends on schedule, not on yours.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Your kingdom is a jewel. I do\x01""so like jewels.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Serve me when the time comes\x01""and you may keep your home.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Out of my way. History is\x01""waiting on me.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""Remember my name. Ganondorf.\x01""You will be saying it often.",
    "\x05\x41Ganondorf:\x05\x40\x01""I leave you unharmed. Call it a\x01""royal favour.",
};
